Description: Tools for simulating, visualizing, and detecting changepoints in 
    univariate and multivariate signals using deep learning and classical 
    statistical methods. Includes utilities for generating piecewise signals, 
    applying rolling-window methods, and integrating MLP-based changepoint 
    detection models.
